  "details": "Title. The loading avatar (blue triangle thing) has had its colors drastically change on quest after the update. I can only validate that this change has happened to the Quest 1 version of the game as that is all i have to test with. The smaller square pic is what you see on quest, its become a MUCH darker blue, nearing invisible in many worlds. The bigger pic shows how it is on desktop, proving that its just a bug with quest. After talking with a few friends i have concluded that its not just me seeing it and that others can see it too. Ive also validated that it can happen in any world, meaning its not a lighting bug either.",
